@startuml
title Storage Routing - Route Scope Lifecycle
hide empty description
[*] --> INPUT_DOC
INPUT_DOC --> RESOLVED_DOC : StorageRouteResolver.resolve
RESOLVED_DOC --> BOUND_DOC : StorageRouteContext.open
BOUND_DOC --> BRIDGED_DOC : bridge to SqlRoute/table
BRIDGED_DOC --> BOUND_DOC : more SQL in same scope
BOUND_DOC --> RESTORED_DOC : close nested scope
RESTORED_DOC --> BOUND_DOC : previous scope exists
BOUND_DOC --> CLEARED_DOC : close outermost scope
CLEARED_DOC --> [*]

state "ROUTE_INPUT [DOC MODEL]\nRouteContext + CompositeShardKey" as INPUT_DOC
state "RESOLVED [DOC MODEL]\nStorageRoute" as RESOLVED_DOC
state "BOUND [DOC MODEL]\ncurrent ThreadLocal route" as BOUND_DOC
state "BRIDGED [DOC MODEL]\nSqlRoute + execution table" as BRIDGED_DOC
state "RESTORED [DOC MODEL]" as RESTORED_DOC
state "CLEARED [DOC MODEL]" as CLEARED_DOC

note right
StorageRouteMode 是真实枚举：
DIRECT_DATASOURCE
SHARDINGSPHERE_JDBC
PROXY

这些是路由模式，不是生命周期状态。
end note
@enduml
